p>(</rp><rt>ひと</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はトムの<ruby>兄弟<rp>(</rp><rt>きょうだい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>にちがいない。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">他是汤姆的兄弟。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">去年</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">きょねん</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n5\" href=\"../../n5/vocab/\">N5</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">副词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">副詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">去年</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"197333\">ビルは<ruby>去年<rp>(</rp><rt>きょねん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>秋<rp>(</rp><rt>あき</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>私<rp>(</rp><rt>わたし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>会<rp>(</rp><rt>あ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>いに<ruby>来<rp>(</rp><rt>き</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>た。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">比尔去年秋天来见我。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">嫌い</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">きらい</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n5\" href=\"../../n5/vocab/\">N5</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">な形容词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">な形容詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">厌恶；讨厌；不喜欢；倾向；带有…的意味；些许；区别；辨别</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"76676\">ジムくんは<ruby>行<rp>(</rp><rt>い</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>き<ruby>過<rp>(</rp><rt>す</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ぎの<ruby>嫌<rp>(</rp><rt>きら</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>いがある。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">吉姆先生不喜欢过度去。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">切る</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">きる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n5\" href=\"../../n5/vocab/\">N5</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">切割；切开；进行（手术）；切断（联系、关系）；关闭（如灯）；终止（如谈话）；挂断（电话）；断开连接；打孔（票）；撕下（票根）；打开（密封物品）；启动；开始；设定（限制）；在规定时间内完成；开具（支票、凭证等）；减少；降低；打折；甩去（水等）；滴干；沥干；穿过；横跨；严厉批评；果断行动；做出显著动作；先手；做出（歌舞伎中的面部表情）；转向（车辆、方向盘等）；使（球）旋转；踢出弧线；削（球）；洗牌；舍牌（麻将）；解雇；开除；驱逐；逐出教会；挖（沟）；刻（蜡纸，用于油印）；出王牌；以大牌压制；（围棋）断；切断两块棋的联络；生火（用木摩擦或以金属击石）；用（剑等）在空中画出（形状）；做完；完成；完全…；彻底…；极其…；清楚地做；果断地做；坚定地做</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"199708\">トランプをよく<ruby>切<rp>(</rp><rt>き</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ってください。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">请仔细切断特朗普。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">着る</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">きる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n5\" href=\"../../n5/vocab/\">N5</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅱ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅱ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">穿（从肩部往下）；穿上；着装；承担（责任、过错）；担负</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"223601\">このセーターを<ruby>着<rp>(</rp><rt>き</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>てごらんなさい。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">请穿上这件衣服。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">きれい</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n5\" href=\"../../n5/vocab/\">N5</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">な形容词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">な形容詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">漂亮；可爱；美丽；秀丽；干净；清洁；纯净；整洁；整齐；彻底；完全</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"205929\">それからすっきりきれいにしてくれ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">然后把它清洁好。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">キロ</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n5\" href=\"../../n5/vocab/\">N5</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">千-；千克；公斤；千米；公里；千-；1024；2的10次方</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"196669\">ヘレンはせいぜい４０キロだ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">海伦最长40公里。</span></div></li>"]